        <h1>About Revenue Data Lab</h1>
      </header>
      <p>Revenue Data Lab is where I explore the intersection of business systems, data, and technology.</p>
      <p>My professional background is in CRM administration, revenue operations, business intelligence, and technical problem-solving. Over time, my work has increasingly focused on improving how organizations collect, organize, connect, and use their data.</p>
      <p>I'm particularly interested in SQL, Python, data engineering, AI, automation, and building systems that reduce manual work while making information more useful.</p>
      <p>This website serves as a record of practical projects, technical experiments, lessons learned, and conversations with other professionals doing interesting work in these fields.</p>
